cais devem estar protegidos contra insetos, ratos, animais e pragas."], "coverage": 1.0, "seed_tag": 0, "gen_model": "Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B-FP8", "created_utc": "2026-09-12T19:58:40.719532+00:00"}}
